"ありがとうございます+"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は夜遅いから、質問はまた今度答えるね（・ω・）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日の「乃木坂ってどこ?公開収録」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頑張るぞー!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさーい（*¨*）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.higuchi/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/02/12/photo_4.png","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"↑大和とまとと・・・♡♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ポーニーテールにしたよ!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、大和とまともおそろいの乃木坂ジャージ☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひな"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-39332":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"集計した新・自己紹介の項目案を\nジャンルごとにまとめ終わりました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日から1週間\n順番に更新していきますね( ´ ▽ ` )ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"【自己紹介 食べもの編】"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・好きなお寿司のネタ\n└鯵、鯛、鰤、鰹たたき、秋刀魚\n金沢ロケのオフのときに\n初めて食べたのどぐろも美味しかった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・好きなお酢\n└なにこの質問。笑  ポン酢かなあ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・好きなおつまみ\n└あたりめ、チー鱈、ししゃも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・好きなパン\n└くるみパン、フランスパン"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・好きなラーメンの味\n└ずっと塩だったけど最近お醤油が好き"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・好きな中華料理\n└父作の炒飯、餃子"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・好きなケーキ\n└生クリーム系よりもタルトが好みです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・好きな和菓子\n└塩豆大福、苺大福、煉切、柴舟\n柴舟は金沢土産にたくさん買った！\nどちらかというと和菓子派です＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・好きなご飯のお供\n└納豆、海苔の佃煮、食べるラー油"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・好きなコーヒーの種類\n└最近ブラックのまま\n飲めるようになったばかりで\nまだそこまで詳しくないです（´-`）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・好きなコーヒーの飲み方\n└ブラックでシロップは気分です\nカフェラテは殆どミルクだと知ってから\nあまり飲まなくなったなぁ。\n自分の好きな濃さで牛乳をあとから\n入れることもあります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・飲んでみたいお酒\n└ないです！\nちなみに成人してから\nまだ一滴も飲んでないです。\n友人が未成年なので機会もないし、\n炭酸も飲めないので\nそこまで興味も湧きませんでした～～\nいつか機会があれば♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・学食派？お弁当派？\n└断然お弁当派。\n理由は無駄な出費を抑えられるから。\nあと食堂行くのめんどくさい...笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・最近やってる健康方法\n└毎食前に青汁を1杯飲む！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・少食に見えるけど実際どう？\n└全然そんなことない！\n食べるの好きです( ´ ▽ ` )\nでも親譲りの生粋の胃の弱さだから\n大食いではないかも。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・他人に理解してもらえない苦手なもの\n└炭酸とアサリ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"小学校の給食で出たアサリご飯が\nジャリってしたのがトラウマです～\n炭酸は飲みこみ方がわからない。\nゆえにお酒も何飲めるかわからない。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、コンビニおにぎりに\n付いてくる海苔を巻くのも苦手。\n今朝もびりびりに破けました...\nむしろあれ一発でうまくいく人いる？\nコツ教えてほしいってくらいです（´-`）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rena.yamazaki/img/files/46/_pre/blog/rena.yamazaki/img/2017/06/20/1803239/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中華街で出会った鳥の丸焼き"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rena.yamazaki/img/files/46/_pre/blog/rena.yamazaki/img/2017/06/20/1803239/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は【自己紹介 日本史編】\nをお届けします～♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"れな"}],"source":"archive"},"sba-keyaki-11437":{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんなーこ(*⌒▽⌒*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は、載せられなかったオフショットを載せます!"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYJ0ZMYV7VXHC6J65JHNYEJ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nこのお洋服お気に入り!\nお団子も久しぶりに出来て嬉しかったなあ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私はリュック派です!\n撮影で使用したリュックはとても大きくて便利でした。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYJ10J94EV6KPXWJQ7DJXKD","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nのんびり。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYJ11GZ02EEJSF8NDS2CQXF","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYJ12GWXDTXMYQGFH03064Q","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nリュックぎゅ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"背景がオシャレ。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYJ13GNVSTMRP86NJ4R427H","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また、撮影したいな!撮影は好きです。色々なお洋服を着れるのが嬉しい＼(　´ω`　)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後に、おだなな。"},{"type":"image","src